{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_2000_place", "source_sha256": "dc2eab181b21579d24af8758a5c8880d3a25c4048161584a8837b0a8c92754ca", "ja": "控え室", "zh": "准备室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_2001_p", "source_sha256": "7b74f48edb10b68b6b6f362281f2df6775582276c1902611f5691d422b21bbf6", "ja": "百合子、それは……今度のドラマの台本か？\nずいぶん熱心に読んでるけど、面白いのか。", "zh": "百合子，那是……这次拍戏的剧本吗？\n我看你读得相当入迷，很有趣吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_2002_026yur", "source_sha256": "4cb92c2dd42e4faf919733bb5c2f03b26b2202fbbe79d7bbe45a43e0c8458525", "ja": "はい、とっても！　台本って、書かれた短いセリフから\n背景や人間関係が、色々と想像できるんですよ！", "zh": "是的，非常有趣！读剧本可以从简短的台词中，\n联想到背景、人际关系，延伸出很多很多想像喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_2003_026yur", "source_sha256": "688e7282f982648b9cc2a13b8e76d183e301a205ae067f14127e86c7c07f1485", "ja": "どんな音楽を聴いて、どんな本を読むのか……\nそういう小さな情報から、人物を想像してみるんです。", "zh": "比如听什么音乐，或是读什么书……\n我会透过这种细节，去试着想像人物。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_2004_p", "source_sha256": "f2517dc8a7affb21fc2590ae068a3f352d1e2fc01fd109510e4c186f55a96460", "ja": "へぇ、すごいな。\nその想像力が、百合子の演技の源なんだな。", "zh": "哦，真厉害。\n那份想像力就是百合子演技的泉源呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_2005_026yur", "source_sha256": "73502e1c1c61ac88efb6115bc99e2d8f4d5795370f3ec9e92f6c678f3be4a96d", "ja": "あとは家族と仲がいいのか、友達は何人いるのか。\n紅茶派か珈琲派かとか、考え始めると止まらなくて！", "zh": "还有和家人关系好不好、有多少朋友，\n喜欢喝红茶还是咖啡之类的，一开始想像就停不下来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_2006_p", "source_sha256": "3dc7117ec77967de31b345d5d1fd882482bcce244ecef9e58ab13a60a2555de3", "ja": "そうか、うん。あんまり想像しすぎるのも……\nほどほどにしておこうな？", "zh": "这样啊，嗯。想像过头也不太好……\n要适可而止喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_026yur_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_026yur_2007_026yur", "source_sha256": "7dd6a050270b35a679567a80093de8a8d8d37bf6e10aec6cd4c9baedf9acf70f", "ja": "はいっ！　{$P$}さん、\nドラマのお仕事ってとっても楽しいですね♪", "zh": "好的！{$P$}先生，\n戏剧的工作真是非常有趣呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
